<article class="env-lemma" id="E32F9F">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/E32F9F">Lemma <span data-tag="E32F9F">4.4.5.10</span>.</a> The $\infty $-category $\Idem $ is weakly contractible. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      An explicit computation shows that the topological space $|\Idem |$ is connected, simply connected, and has vanishing homology in degrees greater than zero. (Alternatively, we can deduce this from Proposition <a href="/tag/2362C5" data-tag="2362C5">4.4.5.15</a> below.) 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>